@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName "STHeiti"
title 改善教室操作與活動結算｜組件圖
actor 教師 as Teacher
actor 學生 as Student

rectangle "教師教室導覽" as Nav
rectangle "分組管理" as Groups
rectangle "題目管理" as Questions
rectangle "老師控制台" as Console
rectangle "結算檢視" as Settlement
rectangle "教室投影" as Projection
rectangle "學生歷史紀錄" as History
rectangle "教師授權與教室範圍" as Access
rectangle "目前活動及出題清單" as Activity
rectangle "已公布的逐題結果" as Result
rectangle "學習單原稿與活動匯出" as Output

Teacher --> Nav
Nav --> Groups : 進入教室的預設工作區
Nav --> Questions
Nav --> Console
Nav --> Projection : 開啟所選教室
Projection --> Access : 確認投影權限
Projection --> Activity : 顯示公開題目與收件狀態
Groups --> Activity : 管理分組
Questions --> Activity : 編修、刪除、排序
Console --> Activity : 主持及審核
Console --> Settlement : 主動進入
Settlement --> Activity : 檢查階段及確認切換
Settlement --> Output : 回填與匯出
Output --> Result : 取目前活動結果
Student --> History
History --> Result : 顯示本組已公布的判定
@enduml
